    "Id": "vehicledef_TOKUGAWA_TKG-154",
    "Name": "Tokugawa TKG-154",
    "Details": "The Tokugawa Heavy Tank is a wheeled heavy tank designed in the Draconis Combine. The vehicle saw extensive use during Operation Bulldog in 3059, where it safeguarded Combine worlds from reprisals from the Clan Smoke Jaguars. It was also used in offensive actions against Jaguar units on Outer Volta, and later saw action during the FedCom Civil War, as well as during the Jihad era. Developed as field refit, the LB-X 10 was replaced with a Thirty-tube Medium Range Missile Launcher with three tons of ammunition. Also added is a TAG designator for artillery support.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 4/6 hexes / 120/180 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       200     30\n<b>Left</b>         165     30\n<b>Right</b>       165     30\n<b>Rear</b>        130     30\n<b>Turret</b>      180     30\n\n<b>Total</b>      840    150</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Enhanced FPE</color>",
    "Icon": "Tokugawa"
  },
